# Example .env.local Configuration

Copy this file and rename it to `.env.local`, then fill in your actual HubSpot credentials.

## How to Get These Values

### 1. Portal ID
- Log into HubSpot
- Go to Settings (⚙️) → Account Setup
- Copy your Hub ID

### 2. Form GUIDs
- Go to Marketing → Lead Capture → Forms
- Create or open a form
- Click "Share" or "Embed"
- Find the GUID in the embed code (format: xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx)

---

# HubSpot Configuration
VITE_HUBSPOT_PORTAL_ID=12345678
VITE_HUBSPOT_ENQUIRY_FORM_ID=a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890
VITE_HUBSPOT_CONTACT_FORM_ID=b2c3d4e5-f6g7-8901-bcde-fg2345678901
VITE_HUBSPOT_DARK_ENQUIRY_FORM_ID=c3d4e5f6-g7h8-9012-cdef-gh3456789012
